The companion file [`plot005_product_inventory.csv`](../assets/chapter03/plot005/plot005_product_inventory.csv) records the available raster filenames, resolutions, valid-pixel counts, and value ranges. The companion [`plot005_provenance.md`](../assets/chapter03/plot005/plot005_provenance.md) records figure-production provenance. The figures are **static assets**: MkDocs does not rerun point-cloud processing.

