| Evidence | Plot 005 product | Figure group | Command that generates the product family | Evidence status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `Plot_005.laz`, `Clip_Plot_005.json` | Buffered clip, core geometry | Figures 3.1–3.3 | `fastgc gis --sampling random ...` (§3.3) | Plot 005 metadata examined |
| Classified plot LAS | `FAST_GC` | Figures 3.1–3.2 | `fastgc --workflow plots-run ... --products FAST_GC` (§3.9) | Supplied point-cloud output |
